                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.1.2+MAL.1.3+MAL.1.4+MAL.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1.2-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ena bae etejo Olaitoriani naipirta Edom: “Aimeekure etii eng'eno atua Teman? Keidaayie enkiguana te lelo ang'eni? Keimisiloyie eng'eno enye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elanyisho entushukoto, entotoni tiatua ewueji negut, intae iloomanya Dedan! Amu kayau nanu entaboi e Esau shumata ninye, teina kata naitameyie nanu ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa tenepuonu ilaiturrurrok loo sabibu enitii aimeleku ninche kulikae ng'anayio? Amaa tenepuonu ilapurrok kewarie, aime ina ake nairirikino ninche einyal? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake atooruo nanu Esau nkilani, metaa olmasipai, ataboluo nanu iwuejitin enyena neeisudoriyie, nemeekure eidim aisudori. Eidaikieki nkera enyena, o lalashera lenyena o lelatia enye; nemeekureeetae ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tapala nena kera inono nemeeta menye, kaitopok nanu; nchoo maaisiliga inyi nkolia nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani, “Amaa teneok, lelo lemeishiaakino teneok enkikompe enye enkitamioto ijo iyie ilo mintamio? Milo iyie mintamio, kake meeta nchere pee miok iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ainosa nanu olmumai te kewan ai, Olaitoriani ojo, nchere keaku Basara, entoki naitureisho, enkurruna, olmuaate oldeket, ore nkanas enyena pooki neaku ilmuaateni anaake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atoning'o nanu ilomon supati ooing'uaa Olaitoriani, neirriwakaki olkilikuai atua nkuapi pooki: “Enturrurroto maate tenebo, nipuonunu aarare ninye, nidumakinono olarrabal!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ng'ura, kaaitaa nanu iyie kiti tiatua iloreren, nikimenuni tiatua iltung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena baa naaitureishore nikiteleja iyie, oilo wuasa lo ltau lino, iyie oton too lbaat le ndapidapoi oibung entopij oldoinyo. Ore hoo nipik enkaji ino shumata oleng anaa olkurragos, kaaitadou nanu iyie aitung'uaa ine, Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Keaku Edom entoki naitureisho; ore pooki ng'ae oim embata enye neiputukuny, te nkaraki ina nataraki ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 19.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore anaa enapa natanang'ayioki Sodom o Gomora, o nkanas naatashare, Olaitoriani ojo, meetae oltung'ani oitoki alo aton teine, meetae oltung'ani omany atua ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, ore anaa olng'atuny oilepu alotu aing'uaa entim e Yordan ajing'aki emuatata nagol oo nkerra, kaisho nanu ninche mekueta nabo kata aapuo aaing'uaa ninye, nagelaki nanu shumata ninye oloba anaa olagelu. Amu kaing'ae laanyaanyukie nanu? Kaing'ae laaipotu nanu? Kalo shekut loo ntare oidim aitasho te dukuya nanu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku toning'o enkitobirata naitobira Olaitoriani tialo Edom o eyieunoto naipirakinye ninye lelo oomanya Teman: Keing'irtitori ninye lelo ooti le luaata aaya; ore iluaat enye neiputukuny teina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to ltoilo le mbatatata enye neigirigiro enkop; ore oltoilo le nkishirata enye nening'i te naiposha nanyokie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura kekedisho obo nekuet tiai anaa olkurragos, nelak inaipuko enyena agilunore Basara, ore oltau loo lmurran le Edom netiu akenya ina olong anaa oltau le nkitok te saisai enye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
